# THE TEST CHROMOSOME'S CAPTURE PROBES — hand-edited, BED12, 0-based half-open.
#
# ⭐ THE ANCHORED TWIN BLOCK (owner design, 2026-08-28): the `cap`, `capnasc` and `silent` gene
#   of every block is probed — 15 of 25 transcripts (10 of 20 EXPRESSED — the half the sweep
#   requires); `clean` and `nasc` carry no probe. Probes tile PER EXON, 8 x 125 bp seamless,
#   first probe abutting the exon start and last abutting the exon end, so no probe spans an
#   sj (a split probe suppresses exactly the boundary-crossing gDNA — `docs/TESTING.md` §0b).
#
# One line per probe, tab-separated:
#   test_chr  START  END  NAME  0  .  START  END  0  1  LENGTH  0
